 https://github.com/SimmelFlo/PlcTestSuite

 The point of this FB is to demonstrate that composition (Stage 3) makes
 PLC code testable in a way Stage 1 / Stage 2 cannot match. Every
 dependency is injected via FB_Init; tests construct their unit-under-test
 with mock-or-real dependencies and exercise behavior without touching
 real I/O.

 Drive from MAIN with: TestRunner();   (ungated — every scan runs all
 tests; PlcTestSuite tracks which tests have already executed and only
 re-runs them on TestSuite.ReRunTests()).]]></Comment><BitSize>131392</BitSize><SubItem><Name>__FB_TESTRUNNER__TEST_CYCLEDATALOGGER_ISENABLED__LOCAL</Name><Type>FB_CycleDataLogger</Type><BitSize>51328</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>implicit_inst_var</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>__FB_TESTRUNNER__TEST_CYCLEDATALOGGER_ISENABLED__EXPECTED_BOOL</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>51392</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>implicit_inst_var</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>__FB_TESTRUNNER__TEST_CYCLEDATALOGGER_ISENABLED__ACTUAL_BOOL</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>51400</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>implicit_inst_var</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>__FB_TESTRUNNER__TEST_FILLSTATION_HAPPYPATH_COMPLETESCYCLE__UNIT</Name><Type>FB_StationFill</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Per-method Unit instance (state isolated from other test methods).
